#: src/main.glade:440
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring "
"or KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the "
"TPM when available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only ma"
"ster key. Face auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwal"
"let5 depending on your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Giriş açaryňyzy ýa-da girişdäki KWallet-ni awtomatiki açmak üçin ýüz t"
"anamaklygyny işjeňleşdiriň. Bu, parolyňyzy TPM-de möhürlenen ýa-da diň"
"e kök esasy açary ulanyp AES-256-GCM bilen kodlanan parolyňyzy ygtybar"
"ly saklaýar. “Face auth” iş stoluňyza baglylykda pam_gnome_keyring ýa-"
"da pam_kwallet5 üçin PAM_AUTHTOK."

